  "summary": "DIR-090 AC2 is now RESOLVED, but the directive is APPROVED_FROZEN so the bridge correctly refused my evidence submission (Illegal directive transition APPROVED_FROZEN to EVIDENCE_SUBMITTED). I need a reopen or a follow-up directive to formally record it. Requested decision: (1) reopen DIR-090 for one evidence pass, or (2) issue a new directive to carry the AC2 artifact plus three referrals. Please also rule on the three referrals.\n\nAC2 was reported BLOCKED because an Apache-served unmocked capture returned an empty shell. Root cause was TWO faults, and I have corrected my earlier report: the base path was wrong (the SPA is served at the docroot http://localhost, not under /IME365, and against /IME365/dashboard the app rendered its own 404 page titled Page Not Found IME365 while still answering HTTP 200 via the SPA fallback) AND the API returned 401 to a stub session. Using only the platform own sanctioned mechanism tests/e2e/dir006-session.mjs mintFirebaseSession, which looks a real user up in live Firebase Auth and returns a Google-signed ID token, I produced the first genuine below-the-fold artifact this project has had: served by XAMPP Apache, REAL MariaDB data, scroll verified 0 to 1215, bottom artifact MD5-distinct from the viewport shot (4A031731B75341D680BF787394994A80 vs 0B90E5F3CBD9796801823A6440BD5453), 0 failed api responses, 0 console errors. Live DOM corroborates every fix: rail and ATS donut now agree at 69 percent, the hardcoded 3 new jobs match your profile row is gone, sort and viewToggle are present, zero match-percent tokens in the band, 2 weeks ago instead of 2w ago, and the progress chart renders an honest empty state instead of invented bars. Note dist was STALE (built 14-42-55 vs a 16-17-15 source edit) so I rebuilt it in 3.39s; dist is gitignored so the frozen tree is untouched. Artifacts: .bridge/evidence/dir090-ac2-authenticated-capture.mjs, dir090-ac2-manifest.json, the three PNGs, dir090-ac2-run.log, and report sections 12-14 in .bridge/evidence/DIR-090-forensic-gap-report.md. REFERRALS: (A) F-GAP-7 - DashboardHomepage.jsx is at 278 legacy palette utilities against the dir082 AC6 ceiling of 226 (HEAD is exactly 226 and every DIR-090 insertion contains zero), compounded by dir082 line 67-85 missing its closing brace so AC3 swallows AC6 and one root cause reports as two failures; I did not action it because clearing 52 utilities is a DIR-088-style token sweep needing per-surface visual verification, raising the ceiling would silently relax a ratchet, and editing another directive test semantics is out of scope. (B) the frozen capture_dashboard.mjs defaults to http://localhost/IME365, which resolves to the 404 page while answering 200; the render probe catches it but the default should be http://localhost. (C) no gate checks dist freshness, so a capture can silently evidence code that no longer exists. Invariants held: cv-templates git diff is 0 and 59 of 59 pinned tests pass including the new dir095 7 of 7."
